## Key Concepts Tested
- OTCA telemetry patterns for streaming services
- Per-tenant residency and data isolation
- PII redaction at ingestion point
- Regional Kafka architecture with S3 Parquet sinks
- Tenant/date partitioning strategies
- Quota enforcement and traffic sampling
- Retention policies and lifecycle management
- End-to-end latency measurement

